<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Maze Discovery — 24 Bots</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #1b1e26;
    --panel: #262b36;
    --accent: #4caf50;
    --text: #e8eaf0;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
